  speakerName: ALING RIZA
  speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueText: 'Sometimes, it is about what you experience.

    In Ilokano, ''marikna''
    means ''feel'' or ''perceive.''

    You can use it when talking about experiencing
    something through your senses or emotions.

    Listen carefully: marikna.

    Now,
    try saying ''marikna'' yourself."

'
